<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Pilipshop - Marketplace ng Pinoy</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial; margin: 0; background: #f5f5f5; }
header { background: #ff6600; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
.seller-banner { background: #fff3cd; padding: 20px; text-align: center; margin: 20px; border-radius: 10px; }
.products { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 15px; padding: 20px; }
.product { background: white; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.product img { width: 100%; height: 150px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; }
button { background: #ff6600; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; width: 100%; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; }
button:hover { background: #e55a00; }
footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #333; color: white; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <h1>🛒 PILIPSHOP</h1>
    <p>Marketplace ng mga Pinoy Seller!</p>
</header>

<div class="seller-banner">
    <h2>GUSTO MO MAGBENTA SA PILIPSHOP?</h2>
    <p>Kumita kami pareho! 5% lang commission ko 😊</p>
    <button onclick="alert('PM mo ko sa FB: Richard para maging seller!')">MAGING SELLER</button>
</div>

<div class="products">
    <div class="product">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="T-Shirt">
        <p><b>Seller:</b> Juan Store</p>
        <h3>T-Shirt</h3>
        <p>₱299.00</p>
        <p><b>COD Available</b></p>
        <button onclick="alert('PM mo si Juan Store sa FB!')">Order via Messenger</button>
    </div>

    <div class="product">
        <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/150" alt="Sapatos">
        <p><b>Seller:</b> Ate Nene</p>
        <h3>Sapatos</h3>
        <p>₱899.00</p>
        <p><b>COD Available</b></p>
        <button onclick="alert('PM mo si Ate Nene sa FB!')">Order via Messenger</button>
    </div>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Pilipshop. Gawa ni Kuya ❤️</p>
</footer>
</body>
